   "type": "Annotation",
   "motivation": "supplementing",
   "body": {
    "type": "TextualBody",
    "value": "In our hands is the power to bring to a triumphant conclusion the work for the national suffrage amendment which Miss Anthony began. MAY we have the courage and determination to do what is necessary that in 1917 this half-century struggle of women for political freedom shall be ended.",
